{"version":1,"entries":[{"title":"The Humblers Awaken","tag":"news","category":"Minecraft Dungeons II","date":"2026-11-15","text":"Something ancient stirs beneath the Sift, and it is headed for the surface. Gather your allies, venture into the fungal sporefields, and uncover the source of this unrest!","playPageImage":{"title":"MCD2_DLC_MinecraftLauncher_700x466.png","url":"/v2/images/MCD2DLCMinecraftLauncher700x466.png"},"newsPageImage":{"title":"MCD2_DLC_MinecraftLauncher_772x350.png","url":"/v2/images/MCD2DLCMinecraftLauncher772x350.png","dimensions":{"width":772,"height":350}},"readMoreLink":"https://www.minecraft.net/article/the-humblers-awaken?OCID=Launcher","cardBorder":false,"articleBody":"","newsType":["DungeonsII","News page"],"id":"45d3f1bafa461656182f199d9ef215a8b664d61524da6267e2621598b828ccb9","needsTranslation":true},{"title":"Our cool drop has a cool name","tag":"news","category":"Minecraft for Windows","date":"2026-11-15","text":"Our upcoming game drop has been given a name: Deep Freeze! Delight in the dangers of the ice caves, fall through brittle ice, escape the frostbite, dodge ice balls, and build with new brick sets. Your winter wonderland awaits!","playPageImage":{"title":"MC_DeepFreeze_Launcher_700x466.png","url":"/v2/images/MCDeepFreezeLauncher700x466.png"},"newsPageImage":{"title":"MC_DeepFreeze_Launcher_772x350.png","url":"/v2/images/MCDeepFreezeLauncher772x350.png","dimensions":{"width":772,"height":350}},"readMoreLink":"https://www.minecraft.net/article/twitchcon-gamedrop-name?OCID=Launcher","cardBorder":false,"articleBody":"","newsType":["Java","News page","Bedrock"],"id":"920e34ebe647d216b3d5f111e8d0510efca27fd49494c055f65161fd81b4574d","needsTranslation":true},{"title":"Sound Effects Packs","tag":"news","category":"Minecraft for Windows","date":"2026-11-10","text":"What’s that noise? It’s Sound Effects Packs! Make your world sound more chaotic, cozy, creepy, or downright weird. Customize mobs, blocks, combat, ambience, and more. Share